1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,000
Welcome to the subtitle editor!

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:05,000
This is an example SRT file
with multiple lines of text.

3
00:00:05,500 --> 00:00:08,000
You can edit the text,
adjust timing,
and even have three lines!

4
00:00:08,500 --> 00:00:11,000
Use Ctrl+N to add new subtitles.

5
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Press Delete to remove them.

6
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,500
Ctrl+D duplicates the selected subtitle.

7
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Ctrl+Up and Ctrl+Down move subtitles.

8
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,000
Use the Time Shift dialog for batch operations.

9
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,000
All changes can be undone with Ctrl+Z.

10
00:00:27,500 --> 00:00:30,000
And redone with Ctrl+Shift+Z!

